title: "metatopia"
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite the accompanying paper listed under
  `preferred-citation`. The datasets and model checkpoints are archived
  separately at https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.15172933; cite that record only
  when referencing the data or a specific checkpoint.
