repository-code: "https://github.com/bessagroup/metatopia"
url: "https://github.com/bessagroup/metatopia"
abstract: >-
  A JAX library for meta-learning research in neural topology optimization.
  Provides neural field parameterizations of structural designs, a
  differentiable compliance solver, optimization-based meta-learners (MAML and
  Reptile), and tooling for generating pseudorandom topology optimization tasks.
keywords:
  - topology optimization
  - meta-learning
  - neural fields
  - jax
  - structural optimization
  - scientific machine learning
